.widget_preview/

# Firebase config — contains a real API key + project identifiers.
# GitHub secret scanning flagged this after it was committed directly to
# main (d462fef, 2026-09-10) bypassing this file. Removed from tracking in
# the same change that adds this line (git rm --cached) — the local copy
# stays on disk, it just stops going into commits from here on.
# NOTE: git rm --cached does not scrub the file from history — it's still
# readable in d462fef on origin/main. Untracking it only stops the bleeding
# going forward; if it needs to be gone from history too, that's a
# separate, disruptive history-rewrite operation, not done here.
android/app/google-services.json
